    "description": "Develop accessible mobile applications (iOS and Android) conforming to RAAM 1.1 (Luxembourg Mobile Accessibility Assessment Framework, based on EN 301 549 v3.2.1 / WCAG 2.1). Use when building native mobile apps, React Native, Flutter, or any mobile UI that must meet Luxembourg accessibility law. Covers all 15 RAAM themes with platform-specific code guidance. Default conformance target: Level AA.\n",
